The stone door has sealed behind me inside the barrow. All nineteen treasures of the Great Underground Empire — from the jeweled egg and golden canary to the crystal skull, huge diamond, and solid-gold coffin — rest safely in the trophy case at the white house.

**The adventure in summary:**
- Broke into the white house, armed myself with the elvish sword and brass lantern, and opened the trap door beneath the rug
- Defeated the troll, echoed the Loud Room for the platinum bar, and banished the cyclops with the name "ULYSSES"
- Rappelled the Dome Room on the attic rope to claim the ivory torch, gold coffin, and sceptre
- Opened the sluice gates of Flood Control Dam #3 to drain the reservoir for the trunk of jewels and crystal trident
- Braved the bat-infested coal mine, ferrying coal by basket to forge a huge diamond in the machine room
- Hunted down and slew the thief in his treasure room, reclaiming the chalice and my stolen loot
- Performed the exorcism ritual — bell, book, and candle — to seize the crystal skull from the Land of the Dead
- Rafted the Frigid River for the emerald, dug up the jeweled scarab, and waved the sceptre to walk the rainbow to the pot of gold
- Died once to a lurking grue, was resurrected at the altar, and finished the job

The Great Underground Empire has been mastered.
